__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
# Anchored to the repo root ON PURPOSE. An unanchored `data/` also matches
# src/sol_execbench/core/data/ and tests/sol_execbench/core/data/, and in
# session 1 it silently excluded the vendored data-model package from the
# commit -- the code imported it, the working tree had it, and git did not.
# See STATE.md deviation D6.
/data/
artifacts/**/logs/
# Golden reference tensors: 143 GB of regenerable float64 CPU output.
# `scripts/gen_golden.py` rebuilds them from the dataset on any machine, with
# no GPU. The per-workload report beside them IS tracked, because which tier
# produced each golden (float64 vs native_cpu) is a finding, not data.
artifacts/golden/*.pt
# The reduced harness tree each agent sweep verifies against. A derived copy of
# src/ and a few scripts, rebuilt by task_packet.build_verify_root on demand;
# committing it would duplicate the source tree once per run.
artifacts/10/runs/*/verify-root/
# Scratch an agent left in its packet. The solution.json and its declared
# sources ARE tracked -- they are the result -- but the debug scripts, probes and
# local test harnesses an agent wrote along the way are not, and they arrive with
# unpredictable names.
artifacts/10/runs/*/*/packet/__pycache__/
*.so
.venv/
uv.lock
.uv-cache/
